;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Brightness</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">98%-100%</span></span> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Quality Grade</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">A+</span></span> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"></span> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"></span> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"></span> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"></span> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"></span> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"></span> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <table border="1" width="102%"> <tbody> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Brightness</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">104%-106%</span></span> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Quality Grade</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">A++</span></span> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"></span> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"></span> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"></span> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"></span> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"></span> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"></span> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p align="left" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="font-size:16px;"><span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Under the mixed wooden pulp : It is only single quality according the brightness ---94%-96% ;</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Under the 100 % wooden pulp : They are two qualities according the brightness ;</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">1.98%-100% brightness ( super quality ,and super brightness),</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">2.104%-106% brightness ( high super quality ,and high super brightness).</span><br/> <br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">The Spec. Are :</span></span></span></p> <table border="1" width="89%"> <tbody> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" width="36%"> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">GSM</span></span></p> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">( Gram Weight/Square Meter)</span></span></p> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" width="64%"> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">1. 70 GSM ,</span></span></p> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">2. 75 GSM,</span></span></p> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">3. 80 GSM .</span></span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Size</span></span></p> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">( Ordinary Size )</span></span></p> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">1. 8.5’*11''(216mm*279mm),</span></span></p> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">2. A4 (210mm*297mm),</span></span></p> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">3. 8.5’*13''(216mm*330mm),</span></span></p> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="font-size:16px;"><span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">4. Other size : In jumbo roll or in other sheet size like 8.5''*16''and so forth .</span><br/> </span></span></p> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p align="left" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Paper Weight DATA For Customer Reference :</span></span></p> <table border="1" width="90%"> <tbody> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" width="8%"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">GSM</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" width="26%"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">