e="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">500 pieces/ream ,</span></span></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">5 reams/carton ,</span></span></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">8000 reams/20GP.</span></span></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="font-size:16px;"></span></p> <p style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="font-size:16px;"></span></p> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">70GSM</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">216mm*330mm (8.5''*13'')</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">400</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">2.4948</span></span> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">70GSM</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:1