79mm (8.5''*11'')</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">444</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">2.2599</span></span> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">75GSM</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">216mm*330mm (8.5''*13'')</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">375</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">2.6730</span></span> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">75GSM</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">210mm*297mm (A4)</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">430</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">2.3389</span></span> </div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p align="left" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="font-size:16px;"><span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Note : 1. (Reams/Ton)--- per ton jumbo roll paper can be slitted out 400 reams of 80 GSM ,A4 size paper .</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">2. A3 size is twice of A4 size .</span></span></span></p> <p align="left" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="font-size:16px;"><span style=''font-family:"";''><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Paper Package Size DATA For Customer Reference :</span></span></span></p> <table border="1" width="91%"> <tbody> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">A4 Size</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">210mm*297mm</span></span> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">A3 Size</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">420mm*297mm</span></span> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Box( Carton) Size</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">310mm*220mm*240mm</span></span> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Pallet Size( Wooden or Plastic )</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">1120mm*960mm*130mm</span></span> </div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p align="left" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="font-size:16px;"><span style=''font-family:"";''><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Loading Details Of The Container ( 20GP ,40GP,40HQ ) :</span></span></span></p> <p align="left" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">1. Without pallets packaging details ( usually use 20GP ) :</span></span></p> <p align="left" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Such as A4 Size :</span></span></p> <table border="1" width="92%"> <tbody> <tr> <td height="33" style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" width="28%"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">A4 Size</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" width="32%"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Reams/20GP</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;" width="40%"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Kg/20GP</span></span> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td height="33" style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">70 GSM</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">8400</span></span> </div> </td> <td rowspan="3" style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Net weight : Around 18,500KG</span></span></p> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Gross weight :Around 19,500KG</span></span></p> <p align="center" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Note: Per 20GP only allows to load 18,000KG +/-2,000KG.</span></span></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td height="32" style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">75 GSM</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">8200</span></span> </div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td height="24" style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">80 GSM</span></span> </div> </td> <td style="text-align:left;font-family:宋体;font-size:9pt;"> <div align="center"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">7800</span></span> </div> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p align="left" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">2. With pallets packaging details ( usually use 40GP ) :</span></span></p> <p align="left" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Such as 70 GSM :</span></span></p> <p align="left" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="font-size:16px;"><span style=''font-family:"";''><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">1.) 8.5''*11''</span></span></span></p> <p align="left" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="font-size:16px;"><span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Per 40GP can load 11,840 reams , and use 45 pallets .</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">pallet size is 885*1140*17MM</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">per pallets loading : 15reams *4(layer)=60 reams for belowing</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">per pallets loading : 15reams *3(layer)=45reams for upper</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">and total pallets for per 40GP is 22(belowing layer ) +22(upper layer )=44 pallets .</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">as for the loading of the 40GP , 22 pallets in belowing and 22 pallats in upper . And belowing is 4 layers, and upper is 3 layers.</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">By the way , for the excess weight limited by the vessel shipping co., per 40GP only allow to load about 26 tons .</span><br/> <br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">2.) 8.5''*13''</span></span></span></p> <p align="left" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="font-size:16px;"><span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Per 40GP can load 11,520 reams , and use 45 pallets .</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">pallet size is 1030*1140*17MM</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">per pallets loading : 15reams *4(layer)=60 reams for belowing</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">per pallets loading : 15reams *3(layer)=45reams for upper</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">and total pallets for per 40GP is 22(belowing layer ) +21(upper layer )=43pallets .</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">as for the loading of the 40GP , 22 pallets in belowing and 21 pallats in upper .And belowing is 4 layers, and upper is 3 layers.</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">By the way , for the excess weight limited by the vessel shipping co. , per 40GP only allow to load about 26 tons .</span><br/> <br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">3.) A4</span></span></span></p> <p align="left" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="font-size:16px;"><span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Per 40GP can load 11,840 reams , and use 45 pallets .</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">pallet size is 885*1140*17MM</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">per pallets loading : 15reams *4(layer)=60 reams for belowing</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">per pallets loading : 15reams *3(layer)=45reams for upper</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">and total pallets for per 40GP is 23(belowing layer ) +22(upper layer )=45pallets .</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">as for the loading of the 40GP , 23 pallets in belowing and 22pallats in upper .And belowing is 4 layers, and upper is 3 layers.</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">By the way , for the excess weight limited by the vessel shipping co. , per 40GP only allow to load about 26 tons .</span></span></span></p> <p align="left" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="font-size:16px;"><span style=''font-family:"";''><br/> <span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Use Customer''s Logo :</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Using customer''s own logo on Ream Wrappers and Carton Wrappers (inner and outer packaging design) ,we could do it for Huge/Medium-Order &amp; Steady-Order Customers .The Logo can be offerred/designed by the customer themselves or can be designed by us .</span></span></span></span></p> <p align="left" style="text-indent:20pt;"> <span style="font-size:16px;"><span style=''font-family:"";''><br/> <span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Tech Data &amp; Test Report</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Super premium multi-purpose A4 papers no recycling.</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Basic weight: 70 ,75,80g/m2,</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Moisture 3.5%-4.5%,</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Whiteness: &gt;98%</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Thickness: 103-110 μm</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Surface roughness TS ml/min: 75-175</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Surface roughness BS ml/min: 100-200</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Bending stiffness MD: &gt;110 Mn</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Bending stiffness CD: &gt;50 Mn</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Opacity: &gt;94%</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Brightness: 101-104%</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">CIE whiteness: 148-152</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Cobb Test: 27-33 g/m2 27-33</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Key Performance</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">No jam in photocopy machine</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">No double feed</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Stay flat after copying</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Leave no dust in the copy-machine</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Nice appearance-white and clean</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Nice touch-smooth and bulky</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">No see through-print both sides</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Been developed for : Photocopy Machines, Laser Printers, Ink-jet Printers, Fax Machines</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Packaging :500 sheets/ream, 5 reams/carton</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">All cartons must be packed on pallets or not</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Min. order : At least 1*20CP containers required</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Quantity Required : N x 20GP containers / N x 40GP containers</span></span></span></span></p>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO cms_items (c_id, i_id, title, pic, content, addtime) VALUES (64, 426, 'Jumbo rolls Copy paper', '../upload/image/20211220/20211220132600_15520.jpg', '<p><h4> <span style="font-size:18px;font-family:Tahoma;color:#009900;">Jumbo rolls Copy paper<br/> </span><span style="font-size:18px;font-family:Tahoma;color:#009900;">Jumbo rolls Copy paper to be slited the&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size:18px;font-family:Tahoma;color:#009900;"><span style="font-size:18px;font-family:Tahoma;color:#009900;">A4 COPY PAPER finished size</span><br/> </span><span style="font-size:18px;font-family:Tahoma;color:#009900;">--- 70,75,80G COPY PAPERJUMBO ROLLS, 100% virgin wood pulp Jumbo rolls to slit A4 sizes sheets , whiteness:100%&nbsp;&nbsp;<br/> </span><span style="color:#009900;font-size:18px;font-family:Tahoma;">--- Jumbo roll paper roll width: 840-848,1055-1056mm....&nbsp;<br/> </span><span style="font-size:18px;font-family:Tahoma;color:#009900;">--- Roll outer diameter: within1200rnm,&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br/> </span><span style="font-size:18px;font-family:Tahoma;color:#009900;">--- Inner Core:76mm or 152mm (usually we offer 3inch=76MM)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br/> </span><span style="font-size:18px;font-family:Tahoma;color:#009900;">--- Suit for the&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size:18px;font-family:Tahoma;color:#009900;">SHEETING &amp; WRAPPING MACHINE&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size:18px;font-family:Tahoma;color:#009900;">(speed)&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size:18px;font-family:Tahoma;color:#009900;">: 34—37 reams/min&nbsp;<br/> </span><span style="font-size:18px;font-family:Tahoma;color:#009900;">--- HS code: 4802620000&nbsp;</span> </h4></p>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO cms_items (c_id, i_id, title, pic, content, addtime) VALUES (64, 280, 'Waterproof Glossy/Matte RC Photo Paper', '../upload/image/20181227/20181227121811_35718.jpg', '<p></p><p style="text-align:left;color:#59595B;text-indent:20pt;font-family:宋体;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"><strong>Waterproof Glossy/Matte RC Photo Paper</strong></span></p> <p style="text-align:left;color:#59595B;text-indent:20pt;font-family:宋体;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">1)Weight: 120-350GSM</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">3)Water proof</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">4)instant dry</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">5)WIDTH: A6/A4/A3/0.914/1.07/1.27/1.37/1.52M</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">6)THICKNESS: 0.25mm/0.27mm</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">6)Suitable for all inkjet printers, up to 2880 / 5760DPI</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">7)Packing: Sheets A3 A4 A6,Rolls carton packed </span></span></p> <p style="text-align:left;color:#59595B;text-indent:20pt;font-family:宋体;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span style=''font-family:"";''><span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">OUR PROFESSIONAL PRODUCTS</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">1) Sheets A3 A4 A6 :</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> SUPER CAST COATED GLOSSY PHOTO PAPER 200/220/240 GSM</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> CAST COATED GLOSSY PHOTO 150/180/200/220/240 GSM</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> INKJET PAPER 108/128/160/200 GSM</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> 2SIDES CAST COATED 220/260 GSM</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> 2SIDES MATT COATED 220/240 GSM</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> 1SIDE CAST 1SIDE MATT 200/240 GSM</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> RC Waterproof Photo Paper 260 gsm</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">2)Rolls Water Based Materials:</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> Waterproof PP Film 150 180</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> Waterproof PP Film With Adhesive 120 150 180</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> Waterproof PVC Film With Adhesive</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> PP Film 150 180 185</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> PP Film With Adhesive 120 150 180</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> Glossy PVC Film With Adhesive</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> Glossy PP Film 150 180 185</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> Glossy PP Film With Adhesive 150 180</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> Waterproof Glossy Photo Paper 200 240</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> Waterproof Matte Photo Paper 180 220</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> Waterproof Matte Photo Paper With Adhesive 180 220</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> Glossy Photo Paper 240</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> Semi-Glossy Photo Paper 240</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> Glossy Photo Paper With Adhesive 240</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> Waterproof Canvas</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> Canvas</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">3)Rolls Solvent Materials:</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> Solvent PP Film</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> One Way Vision</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> Self Adhesive Vinyl</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> Solvent Photo Paper</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">4)Lamination Films:</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;"> Glossy Lamination Film 70 80 </span></span></span></p> <p style="text-align:left;color:#59595B;text-indent:20pt;font-family:宋体;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''>RC PHOTO PAPER ( TEST REPORT )</span></p> <p style="text-align:left;color:#59595B;text-indent:20pt;font-family:宋体;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><img border="0" src="../upload/image/no-photo.png"/></span></p> <p style="text-align:left;color:#59595B;text-indent:20pt;font-family:宋体;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;background-color:#FFFFFF;"> <span style=''font-family:"font-size:22px;''><img border="0" src="../upload/image/no-photo.png"/></span></p> <p style="text-align:left;color:#59595B;text-indent:20pt;font-family:宋体;font-s